<title>SAN MARINO: SOCCER-BELGIUM BEAT SAN MARINO 5-1 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BELGIUM BEAT SAN MARINO 5-1 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>SAN MARINO 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgium beat San Marino 5-1</p>
<p>(halftime 1-1) in their European under-21 group seven soccer</p>
<p>qualifier on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>San Marino - Mpenza (12th)</p>
<p>Belgium - De Luigi (22th, pen), Baseggio (48th, 87th),</p>
<p>J'Bari (65th), Vanhoudt (85th)</p>
</text>
